893 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (These guides are the result of our data analytics expertise, direct experience interviewing at companies, and countless conversations with job candidates. Its goal is to teach by example - not only by giving you a list of interview questions and their answers, but also by sharing the techniques and thought processes behind each question and the expected answer. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
