/ActualText (The DS & AI Masters Course at Zep Analytics is an extensive program designed to provide in-depth knowledge and practical skills in data science and artificial intelligence. This course covers a wide range of modules, including Python, SQL, Machine Learning \(ML\), Natural Language Processing \(NLP\), Deep Learning \(DL\), and Transformers.)
