907 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (With over 30 hands-on projects, participants will gain real-world experience by applying their skills to solve complex problems. The curriculum emphasizes the latest advancements in Generative AI, ensuring that learners are well-prepared for the evolving demands of the tech industry. This course is ideal for anyone looking to build a robust foundation in data science and AI, making it a valuable asset for both beginners and professionals seeking to enhance their expertise.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
