/S /P
/P 2610 0 R
/ActualText (Text Generation: Used in chatbots, virtual assistants, content creation, and story writing. LLMs generate human-like text for conversation, summarization, or creative writing.   )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1002 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
