/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1003 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2612 0 R
/ActualText (Audio and Music Generation: AI creates music, voiceovers, and sound effects, allowing for automated audio production in entertainment and media.   )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1004 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2613 0 R
/ActualText (Code Generation: AI systems like GitHub Copilot assist developers by generating code snippets, reducing the time needed for coding tasks.  )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1005 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2614 0 R
/ActualText (Style Transfer: Generative AI can apply artistic styles to images or videos, commonly used in digital art and media. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
