/P 2620 0 R
/ActualText (Common Use Cases: Image classification, spam detection, and similar tasks where precise boundary distinctions are key. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1028 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (2. Generative Models: )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1029 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
