>>
endobj
1031 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2622 0 R
/ActualText (Working Mechanism: These models essentially try to understand how data is structured across different classes, enabling them to create new data instances that resemble the original dataset. Examples include Gaussian Mixture Models, Hidden Markov Models, and deep generative models like GANs \(Generative Adversarial Networks\). )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
