/ActualText (4. Autoregressive Models \(e.g., PixelCNN, WaveNet\): These models generate data sequentially, predicting the next element based on previously generated ones. They are commonly used in tasks like image generation \(PixelCNN\) and audio generation \(WaveNet\). )
/Pg 30 0 R
