endobj
1105 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Generative AI has several limitations, despite its impressive capabilities:  )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1106 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2632 0 R
/ActualText (Limited Knowledge: Generative AI models do not have real-world understanding or deep knowledge. They rely solely on patterns from their training data and may produce incorrect or superficial information when faced with unfamiliar contexts.  )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1108 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2633 0 R
/ActualText (Bias: AI models can perpetuate or amplify biases present in their training data. This can lead to unfair or discriminatory outputs, especially in sensitive areas like hiring or content moderation.   )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (zepanalytics.com)
/E (zepanalytics.com)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [2]
>>
