/Pg 32 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1111 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2634 0 R
/ActualText (Errors: Generative AI can generate factual inaccuracies or logical errors. This is due to the model's inability to reason or verify the correctness of its generated content. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1112 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2635 0 R
/ActualText (Copyright Infringement: AI models may produce content too similar to existing copyrighted material, raising concerns about intellectual property violations.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [3]
>>
