1114 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2636 0 R
/ActualText (Risk of Lay-offs: The automation potential of Generative AI could lead to job displacement in fields that rely on creative or content production tasks, increasing the risk of lay-offs in certain industries. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
