/Pg 32 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Autoencoders play a significant role in Generative AI \(GenAI\) by enabling models to learn efficient, lower-dimensional representations of data, which can then be used for creative generation and transformation tasks. Here's how they contribute:  )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1117 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (1.Dimensionality Reduction and Feature Learning: )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
