>>
endobj
1131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Variational Autoencoders \(VAEs\), a popular variant, add a probabilistic twist by ensuring that points in the latent space follow a specific distribution. This feature enables applications like style transfer \(e.g., converting a photo to a painting\) and controllable generation, where the model can modify outputs based on specific conditions. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
