/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2645 0 R
/ActualText (VAEs have an encoder-decoder structure. The encoder compresses data into a latent representation, while the decoder reconstructs data from this latent space. VAEs use probabilistic encoding, making their outputs more controlled. )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
