/E (2. Training Method:  )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2646 0 R
/ActualText (GANs rely on a minimax game between the generator and discriminator, which can be challenging to balance but produces realistic outputs once converged.  )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
