<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2647 0 R
/ActualText (VAEs use reconstruction loss and KullbackLeibler divergence to optimize the match between the latent space and target distribution, often making them more stable to train. )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [2]
>>
