/ActualText (2.Scaled Dot-Product Attention: Self-attention uses the dot product of queries and keys to measure relevance, scaled down by the square root of the dimension. This output is softmaxed to generate attention weights, which weigh the values.  )
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [0]
>>
