1229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (3.Multi-Head Attention: Instead of a single attention calculation, multi-head attention splits queries, keys, and values into multiple "heads." Each head captures different relationships and perspectives in the data, then combines them for richer representations.  )
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
