/P 2720 0 R
/ActualText (Most RAG setups use vector databases that store embeddings of data \(text, documents, etc.\). Regularly re-indexing this database with newly embedded information ensures that the most recent data is available during retrieval, enabling RAG to answer queries based on the latest context. )
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [1]
>>
