/S /P
/P 2721 0 R
/ActualText (Knowledge sources, like knowledge graphs or vector stores, are often periodically updated, adding new entries and refreshing embeddings for relevance. When RAG retrieves from these stores, it reflects these updates in responses, aligning with recent information as long as the indexing remains frequent. )
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [3]
>>
