/S /P
/P 2722 0 R
/ActualText (RAG pipelines are designed to combine generative capabilities with retrieval, meaning the generative model itself does not need retraining to stay current. By pulling in updated facts and content at retrieval time, it dynamically supplements the generative model's responses with fresh, relevant details. )
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [5]
>>
