/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (LoRA \(Low-Rank Adaptation\) and QLoRA \(Quantized LoRA\) are parameter-efficient finetuning methods designed to reduce the resource requirements of adapting large language models to specific tasks, while still maintaining high performance. They are especially useful for deploying large models on standard or resource-constrained hardware. )
/Pg 80 0 R
/K [3]
>>
