1650 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText ( )
/Pg 98 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1651 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2830 0 R
/ActualText (Description: MAE computes the average absolute difference between pixels in the generated and target images. )
/Pg 98 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1652 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2831 0 R
/ActualText (Contribution: L1 loss encourages the model to match the target image more directly, often leading to sharper outputs than MSE. However, like MSE, it does not capture higher-level perceptual information. )
/Pg 98 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
