1654 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2832 0 R
/ActualText (Description: Perceptual loss uses a pre-trained network \(like VGG\) to compare features extracted from intermediate layers of the generated and target images, rather than pixel values.)
/Pg 98 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
