1682 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2844 0 R
/ActualText (Stable Diffusion operates in latent space rather than pixel space, making it more efficient. This approach begins with a random noise vector in a latent space and gradually removes the noise to reveal the target image. )
/Pg 102 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
