endobj
1704 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2853 0 R
/ActualText (High Computational Requirements: Large models require significant computational power, often necessitating high-performance GPUs or TPUs. The demand for processing power escalates with model size, leading to increased costs.  )
/Pg 104 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
1705 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2854 0 R
/ActualText (Memory Constraints: Training large models can exceed the memory capacity of available hardware, resulting in difficulties managing large datasets and model parameters simultaneously.  )
/Pg 104 0 R
>>
endobj
