1709 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2855 0 R
/ActualText (Massive Datasets: Training generative models often involves large datasets, which can be challenging to collect, clean, and preprocess. The volume of data necessitates robust data management solutions to ensure efficient access and processing.  )
/Pg 105 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1710 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2856 0 R
/ActualText (Data Diversity: Ensuring that training data is diverse and representative is crucial for generating high-quality outputs. However, curating such datasets can be resource intensive.  )
/Pg 105 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
